<title>HONG KONG: RUGBY UNION-SECOND DAY'S RESULTS IN WORLD CUP SEVENS.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-SECOND DAY'S RESULTS IN WORLD CUP SEVENS.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-22</dateline>
<text>
